    "implementation_evidence": "No feature implementation or approved TP/CD+Tests/QA/UAT exists. The separate prerequisite routing repair remains unchanged and proves no native planning/Desktop behavior. Renew affected PRD/SD approvals and TP source mapping after the limited qualification-scope revision.",
